(SPIRIT ISLAND - Demo Rulebook \(Board Game Cafe\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(OVERVIEW) Tj T*
(A cooperative strategy game. The players are spirits of an island defending it from) Tj T*
(Invaders \(explorers, towns and cities\) who spread blight. The native Dahan can help) Tj T*
(you.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A ROUND) Tj T*
(1. Spirit phase: each spirit chooses one growth option \(gain presence, power cards or) Tj T*
(   energy\), gains) Tj T*
(   energy from its presence track and plays power cards up to its card play limit by) Tj T*
(   paying energy.) Tj T*
(2. Fast powers resolve.) Tj T*
(3. Invader phase: blighted island effects, fear cards, then Ravage, Build and Explore,) Tj T*
(   and finally) Tj T*
(   the invader cards move one step along the track.) Tj T*
(4. Slow powers resolve.) Tj T*
(5. Time passes: damage on pieces heals, played cards are discarded.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(INVADER ACTIONS) Tj T*
(- Explore: lands shown on the card get an explorer if they touch a town, a city or the) Tj T*
(   ocean.) Tj T*
(- Build: lands shown on the card that have invaders get a new town or city.) Tj T*
(- Ravage: invaders in the shown lands deal damage: explorer 1, town 2, city 3.) Tj T*
ET
