(DAMAGE AND BLIGHT) Tj T*
(If a ravage deals 2 or more damage to a land, add 1 blight there. Damage is also dealt) Tj T*
(to the Dahan \(2 health each\). Surviving Dahan fight back and deal 2 damage each.) Tj T*
(Invader health: explorer 1, town 2, city 3.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(FEAR) Tj T*
(Destroying a town gives 1 fear and destroying a city 2 fear. When enough fear is) Tj T*
(gathered, the spirits earn fear cards and the terror level rises.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(WINNING) Tj T*
(The spirits win immediately when the victory condition of the current terror level is) Tj T*
(met:) Tj T*
(- Terror level 1: no invaders on the island.) Tj T*
(- Terror level 2: no towns or cities on the island.) Tj T*
(- Terror level 3: no cities on the island.) Tj T*
(They also win if the fear card deck is emptied.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(LOSING) Tj T*
(The spirits lose if the blight card runs out of blight, if a spirit has no presence) Tj T*
(left on the island, or if the invader deck runs out when it must be drawn.) Tj T*
ET
